{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02683","headline":"奉和出颖至淮应令 · 蔡允恭","name":"奉和出颖至淮应令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久倦川涂曲，忽此望淮圻。\n波长泛淼淼，眺迥情依依。\n稍觉金乌转，渐见锦帆稀。\n欲知仁化洽，讴歌满路归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡允恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}